WEBVTT

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:44.180
Deep Sleep Remembrance

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.270
Guchuko!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.110
Are you alright?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.200
I got it, I got it. You can't move, right?

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.720
Stop trying so hard.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.760
You don't seem to be hurt. Were your hips stuck?

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:55.800
Sorry, sorry.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.750
Hey, you guys are alive too, huh?

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.060
Who's that girl, Kyo-chan?

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.820
Her name's Guchuko and these guys are...

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.360
I'm not really sure...

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:11.590
Hey, don't you feel like you've lost when you press the button before other people?

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:12.960
Yeah, I do.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:13.830
You do?

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.110
You do! Right?

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.100
You sure?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.790
Sure! You're a loser. A loser!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:26.640
Next is East Suehiro Street, Kizuki Cinema.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.660
Please press the buzzer if you'd like to stop.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:32.670
Press it.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.730
You press it, Ei-chan.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:49.920
Hey.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.240
Where is this?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.410
Who knows.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:58.230
Hey, I'm begging you two, stop being so stubborn and press the buzzer!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.920
When does the next bus come again?

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:22.640
3:45.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.120
What time is it now?

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.390
3:05.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.050
Hey, how about we walk?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.360
No way.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.680
Did the bus pass by this river?

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:21.170
It did! I remember.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.460
Are you sure?

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:26.300
I'm sure it didn't!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.230
It did pass here.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.370
She's a bit weird but cute.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:42.970
Yeah.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.230
She's a good girl too.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.940
Y-You're right.

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:31.240
Convenience Store - 5km

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.620
Isn't that the highway?

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:25.010
The city should be that way if we go left.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.520
Hey, you want to go the convenience store? I'm thirsty.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.450
Sounds nice. Let's go!

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.910
She's so cute and adorable! Are you going to keep her, Kyo-chan?

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:05.030
I'm not going to keep her.

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:10.600
I want to let her wear your clothes when you were small. I'm sure they'd look good on her!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.660
I told you I'm not going to keep her.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.070
You'd feel bad for if she's stuck in this small house, right?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:20.040
Geez, you're calling the house your dad bought small?

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.780
Like I said, she's my friend!

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.840
She's not a pet or anything like that.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:29.230
But she's so small! Aren't you worried about her meals and other stuff?

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.210
And all the more reason because she's your friend!

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:39.140
Thank you, mister!

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.150
No problem!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:44.900
I'm sorry but the police in the city are quite strict so you'll have to keep low.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:45.870
Okay!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.730
Aren't you glad?

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.480
Yes, yes, I'm glad.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:56.960
The truck in front, please stop. The truck in front, please stop.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.160
She's leaving, Kyo-chan!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:14.930
It's okay.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:18.080
Then you put on this dress on her for me!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.010
What are you talking about?

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:52.730
Extra

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:58.630
Guchuko was so cute. I wonder if there's a way to make her my daughter?

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:04.980
Guchuko-chan!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.640
Welcome, Guchuko-chan!

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:37.520
Handkerchief.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:39.610
Check.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:40.980
Gum.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:43.900
Check.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:45.640
Student notebook.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:46.920
Check.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.990
In any case, I'm going to be a third year.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.630
Let's go with spirit.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:57.120
Potemayo.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.300
2kg over.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:12.890
Spring Storm

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:20.680
Moriyama-kun!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.530
We're in the same class this year too.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.620
Let's get along this year too.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.170
Yeah.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:31.560
The charm worked.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.550
I'm glad I put some effort in and continued for three months.

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:39.950
Is this that Moriyama guy?

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.190
Yasumi?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:45.390
You're being tricked by his kindness, idiot!

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:48.160
You've been completely played!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:52.430
W-What strange things are you saying? Onee-chan will get seriously mad!

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.000
Onee-chan!?

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:56.350
W-What?

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.070
Alright, let's see you get seriously mad, Mikan.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.770
C-Call me onee-chan!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.730
A-Are you an idiot?

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:11.930
Sorry, Moriyama-kun.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:16.680
He's my brother, Yasumi and he's transferring here starting this semester.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.780
Hey, don't look away!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.520
That hurts! T-That hurts, Yasumi!

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:23.230
Morning, Moriyama.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:25.650
It's a new record for being in the same class, huh?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.120
Are you going to listen to me?

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.820
Ah, that's right. Mikan is in the same class too.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:29.490
Good.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.580
She'd be really happy if she knew.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:38.970
Who's that?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:43.620
Yasumi, first year. First day of the third semester.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:43.620
3 Months Ago

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.910
Why are you suddenly transferring schools, Yasumi?

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.060
Did something happen around New Years?

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:54.470
My sister...My stupid sister wrote names on my boxers.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.770
B-Boxers?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.790
She said it was a charm to be in the same class as the guy she likes.

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:04.290
No one else but me, everyday, three times...

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.520
Damnit!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:10.360
Moriyama Sunao! You tricked my sister while I wasn't there!

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.340
End of Flashback

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.550
I won't forgive you!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.340
Explanation over.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.960
I knew I shouldn't have gone into a dormitory.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:23.260
I take my eyes off her for a while and this...this bug-eyed glasses guy takes my Mikan!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.770
Now, around that time at the Takamimori residence...

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.590
She is currently pondering why it isn't chirping.

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:57.720
Meat.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.770
It's mostly the same faces and we have the same homeroom teacher too.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.260
There isn't going to be anything different this school year, huh?

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:22.950
It'll be peaceful without any big changes!

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:24.250
Yeah, that's right!

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.090
No change is the best!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.500
Teacher...

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.290
Hey, who is that?

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.010
His name's Natsu Yasumi.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.060
He has a nice feeling about him, huh?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.380
He's really tall!

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:48.250
They say he went to a famous basketball school in his first year.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.570
Why did he transfer then?

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:51.860
Who cares?

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:52.880
Why not?

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.390
Well, he's so cool!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:58.620
Yeah, yeah! And he's so cute holding onto a stuffed toy!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:00.510
Sorry.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.140
I won't forgive you.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:11.120
Here we go! Say cheese!

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.210
Isn't that strange?

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.180
What is?

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:17.940
You say cheese before the shutter closes, right?

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:18.810
Yeah.

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:22.200
When you say "se" when the shutter closes, won't your mouth be like this?

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.430
You should press the button when you say "chee" then.

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:27.540
Wouldn't "chee" be better instead of "cheese" then?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.000
Then what would be good?

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:38.000
Hey, how about "a, b, c"?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.640
Isn't that too long?

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.500
Too long, too long.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:47.110
Geez, could you stop being so irresponsible?

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.050
My finger's completely swollen.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.690
I'm really sorry.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.910
He could've just forcefully pulled out his finger though.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:16:59.100
He's a good guy.

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:04.820
W-What? What are you looking at?

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.150
Hey, don't cling to me!

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:11.640
Do you got it? Huh?

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.050
What is that?

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:15.060
Gum.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:18.200
What are you thinking? Both of you piss me off!

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:21.590
"Coffee"

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:22.950
That's too long.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:24.010
Yeah, too long.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:27.830
"Kim chi"

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.300
"Sashimi"

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:32.100
I don't like it.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:39.660
Anyways, if you put your hands on Mikan I won't let you get away!

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:53.210
Listen, now that I'm back, you won't be able to trick Mikan---

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:58.070
Geez, that's dangerous. Hold on properly!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:00.350
He's a good guy after all.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:04.400
What are you doing, Yasumi? Did you do something rude---

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:07.640
I didn't do anything, idiot! It's more like we were playing.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.630
P-Playing?

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:12.020
Y-Yeah.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:20.420
You're so unfair, Yasumi.

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:22.270
Ah, you're so annoying.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.150
Oh, no, class is about to start!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.820
We have gym next so we gotta change quickly!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.090
Isn't "cheese" fine?

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:38.440
Yeah.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.070
Sorry, Moriyama-kun. I'm really sorry.

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:44.500
Don't push me!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:48.880
Siblings are sure nice.

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:51.620
It's kind of a special relation.

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:02.820
I got it, I got it. Us too, right?

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:09.880
Later.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:13.190
You're slow, slave! Hurry up!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.180
Mutan!

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:22.510
Hey, Moriyama-kun...

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.800
Do you have any plans this Sunday?

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:29.280
Well...if you'd like we can do homework---

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:22.010
How about "cake"?

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.150
Just give it up.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.130
And now, the next day.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.090
Take her with you during gym too!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.860
She walked all the way over here, you know! That's dangerous!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:57.040
Yasumi! Are you being rude or something to Moriyama-kun again?

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.710
Like I said, we're just playing!

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:02.640
That's not fair.

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:03.890
Again with that?

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.610
He really is a good guy.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.360
Extra, part two.

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:43.010
I got you, Guchuko-chan!

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:48.520
Hey, Guchuko's not that type that listens to people. Just give up.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:52.440
What are you talking about, Kyo-chan? I didn't do anything.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.680
Well it's fine either way.
